        <mxCell id="whyDurable" value="⏱ Why Durable Functions?&#10;• Stateful orchestration · history in Task Hub&#10;• Wait for external events without compute cost&#10;• Built-in retry · timer · sub-orchestration · fan-out/fan-in&#10;• Pay-per-execution · ideal for hours-to-days workflows&#10;• Trade-off: orchestrator code must be deterministic" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8EC;strokeColor=#F2A93B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=8;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
